# Paths allowed to still name the removed Claude-on-GitHub-Actions automation
# layer (the gaia-ci lane, its config, and its cron and wiki-drift hooks).
# One repo-relative path or glob per line. Used by
# .gaia/tests/lib/ci-automation-removed.bats, which also fails on an entry that
# matches no hit, so the list never grows stale.
#
# History that is never rewritten.
CHANGELOG.md
wiki/log.md
wiki/meta/**
# Frozen fixtures.
.gaia/tests/fixtures/dedup-key-corpus/**
.gaia/tests/hooks/fixtures/audit-routing-before.tsv
# The forensics lane is out of scope and keeps its own claude-code-action use.
.github/workflows/forensics-triage.yml
.github/forensics/**
wiki/decisions/Forensics Triage Workflow.md
# The forensics claude-code-action working-area ignore entry.
# The deprecated gaia-ci label entry.
.gaia/labels.json
# The guard and this list.
.gaia/tests/lib/ci-automation-removed.bats
.gaia/tests/fixtures/ci-automation-removed.allowlist
